  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="thinking-card">
    <h3>Explain the decision path without looking back</h3>
    <p>Am I naming the mode, locating someone in relation to a specific vehicle, or describing movement? Is this one countable trip, travel in general, or the journey between places? Which exact stop, station, platform, terminal, gate, time, destination, or change does the traveler need?</p>
